    "mds:quote": "Ultralow effective surface recombination velocities down to 2.8 cm/s and 8.3 cm/s, respectively, are achieved on n-type and p-type ﬂoat-zone c-Si wafers."
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/PassivationAcceleration": {
