    "mds:quote": "Titanium oxide (TiO2) is another interesting dielectric ﬁlm for solar cell applications as it has ideal optical properties (\\u2026 refractive index of /C24 2.4 and /C24 1.65 at a wavelength of 632.8 nm)"
