  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/TitaniumOxide": {
    "mds:value": "thermally deposited",
    "mds:quote": "In this work, we demonstrate that thermal atomic layer deposited (ALD) titanium oxide (TiOx)ﬁlms are able to provide a—up to now unprecedented—level of surface passivation."
